        "text": "According to Chief Justice Rehnquist, the Court identified two questions: (1) whether the Ninth Circuit\u2019s rule is correct under Supreme Court precedent, and (2) whether the State court\u2019s contrary ruling was objectively unreasonable under AEDPA."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
