            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, the Court also asked whether the presence of the parents in the interrogation room was relevant to the custody determination."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a60d416f67e36afd559f70ef1eac9e94fd5243a8512418f8adeb75e661ea45f9",
