            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 44,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, a Justice noted that subjective inquiries inevitably involve objective factors, questioning whether an objective test can be applied to a juvenile\u2019s circumstances."
      },
      {
