            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Respondent, respondent counsel pointed out that the district court found the parents were denied permission to attend the interview."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Allen",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a60d416f67e36afd559f70ef1eac9e94fd5243a8512418f8adeb75e661ea45f9",
